WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Harry writes in Tom Riddle's diary.

00:08.000 --> 00:20.500
The diary answers. Its owner has a story to tell.

00:21.300 --> 00:30.000
Riddle offers to show Harry Hogwarts fifty years earlier.

00:30.000 --> 00:39.100
Harry is drawn into the diary's memory.

00:39.100 --> 00:48.000
In the memory, Riddle confronts Hagrid.

00:48.000 --> 00:55.500
Riddle blames Hagrid's creature for the attacks. Hagrid denies it.

00:55.500 --> 01:00.000
Test the diary's account. Inspect the desk and question Riddle.
